	quest.132BAB4518991693.title: "Spirited Crystal"
	quest.132D11B7197AAAD2.quest_desc: [
		"Powah is a tidy power mod with seven tiers: Starter, Basic, Hardened, Blazing, Niotic, Spirited and Nitro. Every machine comes in every tier, and each tier needs the crystal of that tier."
		""
		"The heart of the mod is the §eEnergizing Orb§r. You'll use it for almost every crystal. Start with some clay."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Clay Ball and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.132D11B7197AAAD2.title: "Powah!"
	quest.14459B962CF86074.quest_desc: [
		"The Powah Reactor is a 3x4x3 multiblock of reactor blocks. Place them all, then right-click to form it."
		""
		"Feed it uraninite, keep it cool with water or dry ice, and pair it with some redstone and carbon for a boost. It makes a LOT of power."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reactor (Basic) and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.14459B962CF86074.title: "Reactor"
