	quest.1AB4BBA5F273F8B3.quest_desc: [
		"§eHow to use the orb:§r place the Energizing Orb, then place Energizing Rods up to 4 blocks away with a clear line to the orb. Power the rods, then right-click the orb with the ingredients."
		""
		"When the rods fill the orb's energy bar, your item pops out."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Energizing Orb and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
